      "body_proposal": "ObiWan's recovery had found sand again. His next approach ran wide, and the putt that might have rescued his pride stopped stubbornly short. Duckhook answered with the ordinary cruelty of a controlled finish: no flourish, no apology, just the ball disappearing into the cup. ObiWan kept his eyes on the green. Somewhere behind him, the charity banner lifted in the breeze. The morning remained magnificent. That made it worse.",
