      "body_proposal": "The rear wheel dug instead of climbing. Mud Dogs forced the controls, but each burst only deepened the rut beneath the machine. Water reached the low frame. The finish banner was still there, absurdly close beyond the channel, while the hound's wet fur and racing rig settled into the same brown mire. On the far bank, El Niño held his ground. The storm had not needed to chase its opponent. It had taken away the road.",
      "scene_outcome_proposal": "El Niño wins: Mud Dogs' bike becomes embedded/sucked into deep water and mud and cannot finish; storm physically wins by obstructing race",
