      "body_proposal": "Chili braced a boot against the cart and released the catch. The cooled contents rolled over the rim just as HMB stepped into the serving lane. Red sauce spread across black armor, the gold ornament, and the folds of the ragged cloak. For a heartbeat, nobody in the town moved. Then Chili lifted the ladle in a small, professional salute. The hood remained dark; the eyes remained red. The Belt Keeper had kept his belt. He had not kept his dignity clean.",
