      "body_proposal": "The LLC caught the descending blade and tried to drive through the parry. DK turned around that pressure instead. Four hooves changed the line; the knight's elegant defense suddenly faced empty sand. DK pressed the exposed guard, forcing the challenger backward and down onto one armored knee. The next movement stopped his sword short of the grounded rival. Around them, the crowd rose. The armor remained expensive. The lesson had cost more.",
